        "collapsible_tab-12": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Details & specs",
            "icon": "list",
            "source": "specs",
            "content": "<p>The Forge Pan is VolcanicCore™ in its purest form. A laser-etched LavaCell™ titanium surface sears hard and releases naturally; a triple aluminium core spreads heat from centre to rim in seconds; an 18/10 stainless body and 18/0 magnetic base keep it rigid, flat and induction-ready.</p>",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab-13": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & returns",
            "icon": "truck",
            "source": "custom",
            "content": "<p>Free shipping on orders over €75; below that, the rate is shown at checkout before you pay. Orders are dispatched within one to two working days and usually arrive within two to five, with tracking from the moment they leave us.</p><p><strong>60-day home trial.</strong> Cook with it for up to 60 days from delivery. If it isn't the best pan you own, contact us, send it back clean and complete, and we'll refund the purchase price.</p><p>Your statutory 14-day right of withdrawal applies in addition to the trial.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab-14": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care",
            "icon": "drop",
            "source": "care",
            "content": "<p><strong>Before first use.</strong> Wash in warm, soapy water and dry. Optional: warm the pan, wipe in a teaspoon of neutral oil, heat for two minutes, cool and wipe.</p><p><strong>Every day.</strong> Preheat on medium for two to three minutes, until a drop of water skates. Add oil, let it shimmer, then cook.</p><p><strong>Cleaning.</strong> Warm water and a soft sponge, or the dishwasher. For stuck-on residue, simmer a little water for a minute, then wipe. A splash of white vinegar removes rainbow heat tint.</p><p><strong>Avoid.</strong> Leaving an empty pan on high heat for long, plunging a hot pan into cold water, and abrasive pads on the polished exterior.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab-15": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warranty",
            "icon": "shield",
            "source": "custom",
            "content": "<p>Every VolcanicCore™ piece carries a lifetime warranty for household use. It covers defects in materials and workmanship — including delamination, warping under normal use and handle failure. It doesn't cover cosmetic wear and patina, damage from misuse or accidents, or commercial use.</p><p>This commercial warranty is offered in addition to your statutory rights, which remain unaffected. <a href=\"/pages/warranty\">Full terms</a>.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "complementary-16": {
          "type": "complementary",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Made to go with it",
            "limit": 2
          }
        },
